 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 4,
   "row": 3,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Cities near the Tropic and their States:** Ahmedabad and Gandhinagar (Gujarat), Ujjain, Bhopal and Jabalpur (Madhya Pradesh), Ranchi (Jharkhand), Agartala (Tripura), Aizawl (Mizoram)."
  },
  {
   "book": 4,
   "row": 5,
   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Surface waves:** also called **L-waves** (long waves); they move along the surface, are the slowest and cause the most damage."
  },
  {
   "book": 4,
   "row": 5,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Asthenosphere:** lies in the **upper mantle**, about 100–200 km deep, just below the lithosphere."
  },
  {
   "book": 4,
   "row": 5,
